@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = replace-with-your-api-key
@bearerToken = replace-with-your-bearer-token

### Usuarios sin autenticación
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/users

### Usuarios protegidos con Basic
# Sustituye el valor por Base64 de "BASIC_AUTH_USERNAME:BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD".
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/basic/users
Authorization: Basic <base64-credentials>

### Usuarios protegidos con API Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/apikey/users
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Usuarios protegidos con Bearer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/bearer/users
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Obtener un JWT
# Usa AUTH_USERNAME y AUTH_PASSWORD configurados en .env.
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/jwt/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "change-this-password"
}

### Usuarios protegidos con JWT Bearer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/jwt/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Subir un archivo con API Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/apikey/upload
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ejemplo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Contenido de ejemplo
--WebAppBoundary--
